{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mysterious yet strangely alluring sequel to beloved horror game Fungiman.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a cook and a cook needs their ingredients. What ingredients might require the help of your old friend Fungiman? What's so important that makes you go on a journey through deserts and snowy mountaintops?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806790/extras/f122816f4eec480379c3f0e59a94f42b.poster.avif?t=1760370247\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806790/extras/f122816f4eec480379c3f0e59a94f42b.webm?t=1760370247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806790/extras/f122816f4eec480379c3f0e59a94f42b.mp4?t=1760370247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are making THE donut.</strong> The one world has never seen or tasted before, and Fungiman is there to stop you. Will you let it happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806790/extras/1a70280aaaeb8e68895965171cbd4b5e.poster.avif?t=1760370247\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806790/extras/1a70280aaaeb8e68895965171cbd4b5e.webm?t=1760370247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806790/extras/1a70280aaaeb8e68895965171cbd4b5e.mp4?t=1760370247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><u>Features:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u20